[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18661.19, "timestamp": "05:11:01", "text": "呃，所以只有……呃，有些人才能看。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18662.39, "timestamp": "05:11:02", "text": "但他们不会看到它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18664.23, "timestamp": "05:11:04", "text": "推荐。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18666.23, "timestamp": "05:11:06", "text": "昨天我觉得约翰尼在工作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18668.07, "timestamp": "05:11:08", "text": "因为那该死"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18670.868, "timestamp": "05:11:10", "text": "呃，昨天我做错了事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18674.23, "timestamp": "05:11:14", "text": "他们讨厌《我的世界》这个类别。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18677.99, "timestamp": "05:11:17", "text": "他们给了我一次处罚警告。为什么？哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18679.75, "timestamp": "05:11:19", "text": "哇。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18682.55, "timestamp": "05:11:22", "text": "YouTube 和 Twitch 并非这种伎俩。如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18684.788, "timestamp": "05:11:24", "text": "他们变成了这种骗子，然后我的天哪，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18687.99, "timestamp": "05:11:27", "text": "所有人都会暴动。 D 我要去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18692.628, "timestamp": "05:11:32", "text": "别再搞事了，离开这个平台吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18697.03, "timestamp": "05:11:37", "text": "我简直不敢相信人们会如此……"}]